<title>SPAIN: Spain's July jobless falls to 12.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's July jobless falls to 12.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish Labour Ministry supplied the following figures:</p>
<p>  UNEMPLOYMENT	   JULY 97     JUNE 97	JULY 96</p>
<p> Total (million)		2.01	   2.09	 2.17</p>
<p> Change on month	 -82,694    -31,881     -63,913</p>
<p> Pct of workforce	 12.50	 13.06	 13.67</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are based on registered unemployed.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
